sequenceDiagram
    participant POS as POS Terminal<br/>(Merchant)
    participant Customer as Customer Device
    participant Audio as Ultrasound Audio<br/>Transmission
    
    Note over POS,Customer: Payment Request Phase
    POS->>POS: User enters amount
    POS->>POS: Generate payment request<br/>(PRQ:amount:currency:nonce:merchantId)
    POS->>Audio: Transmit payment request<br/>via ultrasound
    Audio-->>Customer: Receive payment request
    Customer->>Customer: Display payment details<br/>(amount + currency)
    Customer->>Customer: Show PIN input field
    
    Note over POS,Customer: Payment Authorization Phase
    Customer->>Customer: User enters PIN
    Customer->>Customer: Hash PIN with nonce<br/>(SHA-256)
    Customer->>Customer: Generate ACK message<br/>(ACK:nonce:tokenHash:customerId)
    Customer->>Audio: Transmit authorization<br/>via ultrasound
    Audio-->>POS: Receive authorization
    POS->>POS: Validate nonce match
    POS->>POS: Verify payment state
    POS->>POS: Set state to 'authorized'
    POS->>POS: Display success message
    
    Note over POS,Customer: Payment Confirmation Phase
    POS->>POS: Generate FIN message<br/>(FIN:nonce:merchantId)
    POS->>Audio: Transmit confirmation<br/>via ultrasound
    Audio-->>Customer: Receive confirmation
    Customer->>Customer: Validate nonce match
    Customer->>Customer: Set state to 'confirmed'
    Customer->>Customer: Display payment success
    
    Note over POS,Customer: Payment Complete
    POS->>POS: Show payment received<br/>with amount
    Customer->>Customer: Show payment sent<br/>with amount
